OL,3,GNEWSABridge crash repair costs sought
OL,4,Afrom police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council said it was looking to
OL,7,Frecover the full cost of repairing a
OL,8,FGrade II-listed bridge from police
OL,9,Fafter a patrol car crashed into it.
OL,11,FThe vehicle smashed through the stone
OL,12,Fparapet on Worcester Bridge, in
OL,13,FWorcester, back in March after the
OL,14,Fdriver lost the ability to steer when a
OL,15,Flaptop became lodged in the steering
OL,16,Fcolumn.
OL,18,FRepairs, expected to take up to three
OL,19,Fweeks, were started earlier in October
OL,20,Fand Worcestershire County Council said
OL,21,Fdiscussions over the cost were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
